    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property are delighted to bring to the market No. 388 Beechmount Drive, Dundalk. This three-bedroom end-of-terrace property is situated in the established and popular Beechmount residential estate. While the property is in need of a complete makeover, it offers purchasers an excellent opportunity to create a home to their own specification and potentially add value through modernisation. The property will definitely appeal particularly to first-time buyers, investors and purchasers seeking a renovation project in a convenient Dundalk location and all benefits from a rear yard with vehicle access and front garden. For all further details or to arrange a viewing, Contact Blue Sky Property on 042 932 9333. Guide Price : €175,000. \r\n\r\nLocation: Beechmount is an established residential estate on the south side of Dundalk, within convenient reach of local schools, shops, parks and community facilities. Dundalk town centre provides a broad range of retail, leisure, cultural and professional services. The town also benefits from access to the M1 motorway and Dundalk railway station, providing connections towards Dublin and Belfast. Exact distances, school catchment information and journey times should be independently verified by prospective purchasers.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Groundfloor : \r\nEntrance Hall : 4.47m x 2m\r\nLiving Room : 4.5m x 2.88m\r\nKitchen : 3.62m x 2.41m\r\nDining Room : 3.65m x 2.42m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor : \r\nLanding : 2.57m x 2.21m\r\nBedroom 1 : 4.9m x 2.44m\r\nBedroom 2 : 3.32m x 2.49m\r\nBedroom 3 : 3.5m x 2.51m\r\nBathroom : 2.9m x 2.43m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom end-of-terrace home\r\nIn need of complete refurbishment and modernisation.\r\nExcellent opportunity for first-time buyers\r\nSuitable project for investors and renovators\r\nEstablished residential location\r\nPotential side access, subject to verification\r\nConvenient access to Dundalk town centre and local amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E"
      }
    ],
